          <Pad Id="HQexJ4QDRJpLkie6zI6nTh" Bounds="100,95,700,30" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="openness 0 = shy (fold + A6 wrist tremble), 1 = dance (joint sines), continuous in between. Real-robot mode (pad, 0/1) scales all oscillation 0.35x and slows the tremble. Replace the distance IOBox with a camera depth node when ready.">
