          <Pad Id="Fu79NlMtux5MymoXRiSYox" Bounds="1100,735,780,30" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="先启动 uv run kuroko-bridge 再按 play。GET /robot/pose 返回 j1..j7，Split 拆成 Spread&lt;String&gt; 后由 ForEach{TryParse} 逐片解析回 Spread&lt;Float32&gt; 喂给 AxisTarget；左边原来的 distance → shy/dance 链保持不动，改回本地行为时把 Cons.Result 重新接回 AxisTarget.AxisValues。">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String"/>
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
